es.', 'Untreated epithelial HSV, fungal/acanthamoeba keratitis or uncontrolled infection; steroid responders require caution.', 'Can worsen infection, raise IOP and delay epithelial healing; use only with correct diagnosis and monitoring.', 'IOP elevation, cataract, delayed healing, infection exacerbation.', 'IOP, epithelial status, infection control and inflammatory response.', 'pending_review', false, '{"block": "cornea_v1", "review_required": true}'::jsonb) on conflict do nothing;
